  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759239,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 101 Penguin Pets 3D - Nintendo 3DS\n\nGet ready for a flurry of fun with *101 Penguin Pets 3D*! Dive into a vibrant, 3D world where you can adopt and care for over 101 adorable penguin companions. Each penguin is unique, waiting for you to dress them in hilarious outfits – hats, glasses, shoes, and more! Teach your feathered friends amazing tricks like breakdancing and jumping, then show off their skills in exciting dance competitions.\n\nBeyond the fashion and fun, nurture your penguin through vet checkups, bubble baths, and even skiing adventures! A variety of silly minigames keep the gameplay fresh and engaging. Utilize the Nintendo 3DS’s stereoscopic 3D capabilities to zoom, rotate, and truly immerse yourself in the playful world.  From romping in the snow to earning toys and furniture, *101 Penguin Pets 3D* offers endless hours of heartwarming fun and penguin-powered entertainment!  Pamper, play, and love your way to penguin paradise!"
    },
